#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots af dit ansigt, som Ubuntu Hello sammenlignes med. Hold mindst to, "
"optaget i forskellig belysning."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Viser gemte modeller for:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Der er kun registreret én ansigtsmodel. Briller, ændret skæg eller anden "
"belysning ændrer, hvordan kameraet ser dit ansigt, så en enkelt model kan "
"fejle (for eksempel om aftenen i lampelys). Tilføj en anden model med eller "
"uden briller, med dit andet udseende eller i andet lys, så oplåsningen "
"forbliver pålidelig."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tilføj en anden model"

